{"defaultLocale":"en-US","id":"TrackerSoftware.PDF-XChangeStandard","installers":[{"appsAndFeaturesEntries":[{"UpgradeCode":"{B0A987BC-5E91-4930-9437-ABFFA517DBE1}"}],"architecture":"x86","dependencies":[],"elevation":{"requirement":"elevationRequired","source":"inferred"},"fileExtensions":["xcvault"],"id":"x86-machine-wix","installationMetadata":{"DefaultInstallLocation":"%ProgramFiles(x86)%/Tracker Software"},"priority":2,"scope":"machine","sha256":"df6fa2b02781c91ddd0cb006da2761ec79f12657d9e704a411efbff77a864696","silent":{"arguments":"/quiet /norestart","source":"default"},"successCodes":[],"type":"wix","uninstall":{"type":"productCode","value":"{F7D0E9CF-6855-4925-AC40-92BDB7FFD2F1}"},"upgradeBehavior":"install","url":"https://downloads.pdf-xchange.com/11.1.2.0/StandardV11.x86.msi"},{"appsAndFeaturesEntries":[{"UpgradeCode":"{CA231CAC-3C44-45AD-BB95-0F6288945DF6}"}],"architecture":"x64","dependencies":[],"elevation":{"requirement":"elevationRequired","source":"inferred"},"fileExtensions":["xcvault"],"id":"x64-machine-wix","installationMetadata":{"DefaultInstallLocation":"%ProgramFiles%/Tracker Software"},"priority":2,"scope":"machine","sha256":"b954010b2a35b9aea605dece87fb82439d5d61f776ba3ecea5db3cc029cdd3cb","silent":{"arguments":"/quiet /norestart","source":"default"},"successCodes":[],"type":"wix","uninstall":{"type":"productCode","value":"{007CE565-B180-454F-A271-F242FF61352D}"},"upgradeBehavior":"install","url":"https://downloads.pdf-xchange.com/11.1.2.0/StandardV11.x64.msi"},{"appsAndFeaturesEntries":[{"UpgradeCode":"{CEC32EB8-3A4E-493B-8193-EB6DEDDF1D0B}"}],"architecture":"arm64","dependencies":[],"elevation":{"requirement":"elevationRequired","source":"inferred"},"fileExtensions":["xcvault"],"id":"arm64-machine-wix","installationMetadata":{"DefaultInstallLocation":"%ProgramFiles%/Tracker Software"},"priority":2,"scope":"machine","sha256":"1e5237382350afbbd2f775078b1f44497919c957923070dcd1b91ea7578becd2","silent":{"arguments":"/quiet /norestart","source":"default"},"successCodes":[],"type":"wix","uninstall":{"type":"productCode","value":"{A0BCFBD8-4A1C-4D6F-B549-EDB86831C887}"},"upgradeBehavior":"install","url":"https://downloads.pdf-xchange.com/11.1.2.0/StandardV11.ARM64.msi"}],"licenseUrl":"https://www.pdf-xchange.com/terms-of-use","packageLocalizations":{"en-US":{"author":"PDF-XChange Co Ltd.","copyright":"Copyright © 2001-26 by PDF-XChange Co Ltd.","copyrightUrl":"https://www.pdf-xchange.com/terms-of-use","description":"This feature-rich virtual printer allows you to print-to-PDF to create fully compatible, text-searchable PDF files.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Knowledge Base","DocumentUrl":"https://www.pdf-xchange.com/knowledgebase"}],"license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.pdf-xchange.com/terms-of-use","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"PDF-XChange Printer Standard is a virtual printer that is used to convert industry-standard file formats to PDF. It's compatible with files from almost all Windows applications such as MS Word, Excel and AutoCAD. It features an optimized, hybrid engine that significantly increases the quality of conversion for images and image-based text characters, and prints to both GDI and XPS. PDF-XChange Printer Standard installs as a virtual printer that generates fully-compatible, industry-standard, native PDF files. It is used in the same manner as a standard printer - simply open files in their native application, select the option to Print and then select PDF-XChange Printer Standard from the list of available printers. The document will then be converted into PDF. You can also right-click web pages and click 'Convert to PDF' to convert web pages to PDF. There is a wide range of customizable settings available that can be used to enhance and edit converted documents, as detailed in the later chapters of this manual.","name":"PDF-XChange Standard","packageUrl":"https://www.tracker-software.com/product/pdf-xchange-standard","privacyUrl":"https://www.pdf-xchange.com/privacy-policy","publisher":"PDF-XChange Co Ltd.","publisherSupportUrl":"https://www.pdf-xchange.com/support","publisherUrl":"https://www.pdf-xchange.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://www.pdf-xchange.com/product/pdf-xchange-standard/pricing","releaseNotes":"Bug fixes and other updates/enhancements:\n1. Fixed an issue with preserving printer profiles when printing from MS Office apps. (T# 7801)","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.pdf-xchange.com/product/pdf-xchange-standard/history?build=11.1.2.0","tags":["conversion","convert","pdf","print","printer"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"这款功能丰富的虚拟打印机允许您通过打印到 PDF 的方式，创建完全兼容且可进行文本搜索的 PDF 文件。","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"知识库","DocumentUrl":"https://www.pdf-xchange.com/knowledgebase"}],"license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"PDF-XChange Printer Standard 是一款用于将行业标准文件格式转换为 PDF 的虚拟打印机。它兼容几乎所有 Windows 应用程序的文件，如 MS Word、Excel 和 AutoCAD。它采用了优化的混合引擎，显著提高了图像和基于图像的文本字符的转换质量，并支持打印到 GDI 和 XPS。PDF-XChange Printer Standard 以虚拟打印机的形式安装，生成的 PDF 文件完全符合行业标准且具备原生特性。它的使用方法与标准打印机相同——只需在原生应用程序中打开文件，选择“打印”选项，然后从可用打印机列表中选择 PDF-XChange Printer Standard 即可。随后文档将被转换为 PDF。您还可以右键单击网页并点击“转换为 PDF”来将网页转换为 PDF。如本手册后续章节所述，软件提供了广泛的可自定义设置，可用于增强和编辑转换后的文档。","tags":["pdf","打印","打印机","转换"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://www.pdf-xchange.com/support","publisherUrl":"https://www.pdf-xchange.com/","releaseDate":"2026-11-10","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.pdf-xchange.com/product/pdf-xchange-standard/history?build=11.1.2.0","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"96200863b0f60ed1366a8e63e31b367398185907","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/t/TrackerSoftware/PDF-XChangeStandard/11.1.2.0/TrackerSoftware.PDF-XChangeStandard.installer.yaml","sha256":"d6cc18e0d6ddf532f6fe7eeecb42a20fa5874277de3a71f169618cfbc98d247d"},{"path":"manifests/t/TrackerSoftware/PDF-XChangeStandard/11.1.2.0/TrackerSoftware.PDF-XChangeStandard.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"6178c73718ed18dc736da822e0e5b45c10e26ff856493b9321988